{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.dili.2021b.q27.material.recovered", "text": "下面是李老师和林老师在“北方地区和南方地区”一课中的教学导入：李老师在课前布置了一项有点“另类”的预习作业：搜集带有“南”和“北”两字的四字成语或俗语。上课时，李老师先展示学生搜集的信息：南箕北斗、南来北往、南腔北调、南鹤北鹰、南辕北辙、南征北战、南拳北腿、南老北孔、南敞北合、南稻北麦、南蔗北甜、南船北马、南橘北枳、南涝北旱，然后，李老师再引导学生分析这些成语或俗语中体现出来的南北差异。林老师采用了视频导入，分别播放了北方和南方生活场景的视频，学生一边看视频，一边了解南，北方地区的不同生活习俗，并进行记录和对比。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "8b1daf14475258b8a171d58df0db49cc46251d58bd3ceb2949c4c91233ee5595", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2183, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2442, "next_source_question_number": 28, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "8b1daf14475258b8a171d58df0db49cc46251d58bd3ceb2949c4c91233ee5595"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.dili.2021b.q27"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.dili.s1.k11", "ntce.chuzhong.dili.s3.k03", "ntce.chuzhong.dili.s4.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.manage", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.311.r001", "ntce.outline.311.r017", "ntce.outline.311.r018", "ntce.outline.311.r019"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.dili.2021b.q27"], "word_count": 259, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "dili", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "8b1daf14475258b8a171d58df0db49cc46251d58bd3ceb2949c4c91233ee5595", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2183, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2442, "next_source_question_number": 28, "alig